	'messages:config-memcache-badport' => 'en:Memcached port numbers should be between $1 and $2.',
	'messages:config-extensions' => 'en:Extensions',
	'messages:config-extensions-help' => 'en:The extensions listed above were detected in your <code>./extensions</code> directory.

They may require additional configuration, but you can enable them now.',
